    },
    {
      "slot": "field/x:Imap/minUidBatchSize/description",
      "original": "Smallest batch size a client may ask for in a UIDBATCHES command; smaller requests are rejected with a TOOFEW response code. Cannot exceed 500, which is the batch size every server is required to support",
